  <%- include('partials/lang') %>
</header>
<div class="page">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:700">This is a courtesy translation. In case of doubt, the <a href="/prywatnosc?lang=pl">Polish version</a> prevails.</p>

  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <p>The controller of your personal data is <strong>Creditline B.V.</strong> (trading as Pan Frikandel), Torenlaan 5A/5B, Bussum, the Netherlands, KvK 59683198, contact: hallo@panfrikandel.pl.</p>

  <h2>2. What data we process and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Order data</strong> (name, delivery address, e-mail, phone number) — to perform the sales and delivery contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Payment data</strong> — processed by Stripe Payments Europe Ltd.; we do not store card details.</li>
    <li><strong>Shipping data</strong> — passed to the courier company solely for delivery.</li>
    <li><strong>Postcode</strong> entered when checking the local delivery zone — stored without any other data, solely for statistics (assessing the reach of our own delivery service).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Retention period</h2>
  <p>We keep order data for the period required by tax and accounting regulations.</p>

  <h2>4. Recipients</h2>
  <p>Stripe (payments), the courier company (delivery), Resend (order confirmation e-mails) and our hosting provider.</p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, rectify and erase your data, to restrict processing, to data portability, and to lodge a complaint with the Polish supervisory authority (President of the Personal Data Protection Office, UODO).</p>

  <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
  <p>The site uses only strictly necessary technical mechanisms (e.g. storing your cart locally in the browser and remembering your language choice). We do not use marketing or tracking cookies.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">← Back to the shop</a></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
